{"id": "host-diagnostics.01.readonly-first", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/01-diagnostic-safety.md", "anchor": "1. 只读优先", "title": "诊断阶段禁止系统写操作", "tags": ["safety", "readonly", "diagnosis", "write-operation", "separation"], "summary": "诊断阶段必须只采集不修改，修复动作必须与诊断分离并由用户显式触发；诊断的前提是现场未被改变。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/aha-doctor-teardown.md#5.2 唯一的系统写操作"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.01.write-confirm-rollback", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/01-diagnostic-safety.md", "anchor": "2. 写操作的确认与回滚", "title": "写操作必须明示影响、可撤销、记录原状态", "tags": ["safety", "write-operation", "rollback", "confirmation", "module-block"], "summary": "每个修复类写操作须满足明示影响/可撤销/记录原状态三条件；禁止不逐项确认的批量修复，模块屏蔽尤其危险。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.01.least-privilege", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/01-diagnostic-safety.md", "anchor": "3. 提权最小化", "title": "主进程不应提权常驻，提权操作外包给辅助进程", "tags": ["safety", "privilege", "elevation", "uac", "helper-process", "uipi"], "summary": "主进程保持普通权限运行界面，提权操作外包给独立辅助进程；权限不足导致跳过的检测项必须显式标记，禁止静默返回不完整结果。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/aha-doctor-teardown.md#1.1 启动方式与权限"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.01.collected-data-classification", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/01-diagnostic-safety.md", "anchor": "4. 采集数据的密级", "title": "诊断采集数据含环境指纹，禁止未脱敏上报或进版本库", "tags": ["safety", "privacy", "data-classification", "pii", "gitignore", "telemetry"], "summary": "模块列表/网络配置/域名探测结果/硬件信息/用户路径均含可识别信息；诊断产物禁止未脱敏上报、必须列入 gitignore、上报前须取得用户同意。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.01.no-inprocess-injection", "kind": "rule", "level": "SHOULD", "file": "rules/01-diagnostic-safety.md", "anchor": "5. 禁止进程内注入", "title": "不应用 API Hook 采集数据，优先 ETW 等旁路机制", "tags": ["safety", "injection", "api-hook", "detours", "etw", "antivirus-false-positive"], "summary": "托管环境做进程内 hook 不稳定、杀软误报率高、且与只读优先冲突；DNS/剪贴板/键鼠监控应改用 ETW 与系统旁路机制。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md#6. ETW 与 hook 的取舍"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.02.raw-output-first", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/02-evidence-standards.md", "anchor": "1. 原始输出优先", "title": "判据必须基于可复核的原始数据，禁止转述摘要", "tags": ["evidence", "raw-output", "verifiability", "reporting"], "summary": "禁止以「检测到多个可疑模块」这类转述作为判定依据；报告应同时呈现结论与支撑它的原始数据，使复核者能独立验证。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.02.sampling-not-instant", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/02-evidence-standards.md", "anchor": "2. 采样而非瞬时值", "title": "波动型指标必须多次采样，禁止单点定值", "tags": ["evidence", "sampling", "threshold", "cpu", "latency", "false-positive"], "summary": "CPU/内存/磁盘/延迟等波动指标须记录采样次数与窗口，判据应基于「持续时长+阈值」组合；瞬时高值是正常现象，单点判定必然产生大量误报。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.02.degrade-on-faulty-machine", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/02-evidence-standards.md", "anchor": "3. 故障机器上的降级", "title": "取证手段必须有超时与兜底，失败必须显式标记", "tags": ["evidence", "timeout", "fallback", "wmi", "resilience", "silent-failure"], "summary": "每项采集须具备超时/兜底路径/失败可见三要素；禁止采集失败时静默输出「未发现问题」——把「没查到」呈现为「没问题」是最危险的失效形态。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md#2. WMI 的权衡"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.02.time-window-alignment", "kind": "rule", "level": "SHOULD", "file": "rules/02-evidence-standards.md", "anchor": "4. 时间窗口对齐", "title": "多源证据应记录采集时刻并确认窗口重叠", "tags": ["evidence", "timestamp", "correlation", "dynamic-loading"], "summary": "各项采集非瞬时完成，跨源比对前应确认时间窗口重叠；模块动态加载，排查白屏/崩溃应在现象复现后立即采集。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.02.environment-baseline", "kind": "rule", "level": "SHOULD", "file": "rules/02-evidence-standards.md", "anchor": "5. 环境基线", "title": "有条件时应采集正常环境基线用于对比", "tags": ["evidence", "baseline", "comparison", "signal-to-noise", "threshold-calibration"], "summary": "基线用于降低误报、校准阈值、缩小范围；差异判据的信噪比远高于绝对判据，无基线时须相应降低结论强度。", "enforcement": "advisory", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.03.three-strength-levels", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-conclusion-strength.md", "anchor": "1. 三档结论强度", "title": "每条结论必须标注已确认/推测/超出覆盖三档之一", "tags": ["conclusion", "strength", "confidence", "reporting", "decision-support"], "summary": "三档强度的定义与适用条件，禁止用「可能」「疑似」代替明确分级；含三篇 reference 各自的强度基线与原因。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.03.correlation-not-causation", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-conclusion-strength.md", "anchor": "2. 相关性不等于因果", "title": "禁止由「检测到 X 且现象为 Y」判定 X 导致 Y", "tags": ["conclusion", "causality", "correlation", "verification", "false-attribution"], "summary": "四种不成立的推理形态；升级为「已确认」的唯一途径是移除后现象消失且恢复后重现，但该验证属系统修改不在诊断阶段职责内。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.03.declare-out-of-scope", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-conclusion-strength.md", "anchor": "3. 超出覆盖必须显式声明", "title": "无判据支撑时必须声明超出覆盖，禁止强行给结论", "tags": ["conclusion", "out-of-scope", "boundary", "unknown", "reporting"], "summary": "四类必须声明超出覆盖的情形；「未发现问题」与「无法判断」是完全不同的结论，混淆会让用户停止排查或误认为问题不存在。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.03.risk-count-not-fault-count", "kind": "rule", "level": "SHOULD", "file": "rules/03-conclusion-strength.md", "anchor": "4. 风险计数不是故障计数", "title": "呈现结果应按相关性分组，不用「共发现 N 项问题」", "tags": ["conclusion", "reporting", "risk-count", "presentation", "user-behavior"], "summary": "计数模型隐含「N 项都是问题」与「修完就好」两个未验证判断，会驱动用户清零无关检出项；应按确认相关/需要关注/仅供参考三组呈现。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"], "reviewed_at": "2026-09-06", "owner": "desktop client team", "source": ["reference/aha-doctor-teardown.md#4.1 它是宿主应用的定向排查器，不是通用体检工具"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.security-detection-surface", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/security-software.md", "anchor": "1. 检测面", "title": "安全软件的三类检测面：产品清单、防火墙三配置、WFP 过滤器", "tags": ["security-software", "antivirus", "firewall", "wfp", "security-center", "edr"], "summary": "三类可采集信息的能力递减关系；产品清单有两个覆盖缺口（EDR 不注册、卸载残留），防火墙必须分域/专用/公用三配置文件判定，只查一个是常见漏检。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.security-interception-mapping", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/security-software.md", "anchor": "2. 拦截现象映射", "title": "四种拦截方式与对应现象的映射", "tags": ["security-software", "interception", "hips", "quarantine", "symptom-mapping", "update-failure"], "summary": "文件隔离/网络拦截/行为拦截/注入监控四种方式各自的现象与区分点；「特定操作必然失败+重装无效+其他机器正常」强烈指向行为拦截，更新失败应优先考虑本篇。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.security-capability-limits", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/security-software.md", "anchor": "3. 能力与局限", "title": "能查到装了什么，查不到它拦了什么", "tags": ["security-software", "limitation", "interception-log", "causality", "structural-limit"], "summary": "系统接口只提供产品清单不提供拦截事件，这是本篇的结构性限制；禁止由「装了安全软件+出现故障」推出因果，确认拦截的唯一途径是查该产品自身日志。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.security-indirect-evidence", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/security-software.md", "anchor": "4. 间接证据与排除法", "title": "四种间接证据手段：模块交叉、时间线、禁用与白名单验证", "tags": ["security-software", "indirect-evidence", "cross-validation", "exclusion", "whitelist", "rule-update"], "summary": "模块列表交叉验证比安全中心清单更可靠（能发现未注册的 EDR）；时间线比对须考虑规则库静默更新；白名单验证比禁用更安全且是首选处置。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.security-enterprise-context", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/security-software.md", "anchor": "5. 企业管控环境的特殊性", "title": "企业环境：处置建议可能全部不可执行，应产出可交给 IT 的证据", "tags": ["security-software", "enterprise", "group-policy", "it-managed", "whitelist", "remediation-order"], "summary": "策略下发环境中用户无权禁用或改配置，工具定位应转为产出可交给 IT 的证据；处置建议按白名单>调规则>临时禁用>卸载排序，禁止建议长期关闭安全软件。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.security-boundary", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/security-software.md", "anchor": "6. 本篇覆盖边界", "title": "安全软件排查的能力边界：拦截行为不可观察", "tags": ["boundary", "limitation", "security-software", "interception", "quarantine"], "summary": "可确认产品清单、防火墙状态、WFP 过滤器与组件注入事实；判不了拦截了什么、哪条规则命中、文件是否被隔离、未注册产品与规则库更新时点。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.threshold-as-parameter", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/hardware-thresholds.md", "anchor": "1. 阈值的性质：可调参数，不是硬判据", "title": "阈值必须是可调参数并记录定值依据，禁止伪精确", "tags": ["threshold", "calibration", "configuration", "magic-number", "provenance"], "summary": "阈值依赖硬件配置/业务形态/用户预期三者，必须可配置；每个阈值须记录定值依据、校准状态与适用条件；禁止无依据的精确数字。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.cpu-threshold", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/hardware-thresholds.md", "anchor": "2. CPU", "title": "CPU 判据：使用率+持续时长、核心数归一化、因果方向", "tags": ["cpu", "threshold", "duration", "normalization", "causality", "core-count"], "summary": "判据必须是「使用率+持续时长」组合；单进程使用率须按核心数归一化否则口径混乱；CPU 高与无响应的因果可能双向，含三种观察的分流判断。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.memory-threshold", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/hardware-thresholds.md", "anchor": "3. 内存", "title": "内存判据：三个指标的区分，提交量耗尽比物理内存更严重", "tags": ["memory", "commit-charge", "working-set", "page-file", "threshold"], "summary": "物理可用量/提交量/工作集三指标回答不同问题；提交量耗尽导致分配失败（崩溃）而物理内存耗尽只是变慢，诊断内存崩溃应看提交量。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.disk-threshold", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/hardware-thresholds.md", "anchor": "4. 磁盘", "title": "磁盘判据：三类指标与 SSD/HDD 介质前置判定", "tags": ["disk", "threshold", "ssd", "hdd", "queue-length", "system-drive"], "summary": "剩余容量/使用率/队列长度三类指标；判定阈值前必须先确定介质类型否则 HDD 机器持续误报；系统盘应用更保守阈值。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.gpu-rendering-threshold", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/hardware-thresholds.md", "anchor": "5. GPU 与渲染", "title": "GPU 与渲染：硬件加速状态比使用率更重要", "tags": ["gpu", "hardware-acceleration", "software-rendering", "wpf", "render-tier", "fallback"], "summary": "对 WPF 宿主，渲染层级是否回退到软件渲染比 GPU 使用率更关键——软件渲染回退是卡顿高频成因；含五类回退原因与各自判定方式。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.cpu-instruction-set", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/hardware-thresholds.md", "anchor": "6. CPU 型号与指令集兼容性", "title": "指令集兼容性：确定性失败但错误信息无关", "tags": ["cpu", "instruction-set", "compatibility", "startup-crash", "virtual-machine"], "summary": "CPU 不支持所需指令集时必然失败，但有三个特征使其难排查：确定性复现易误判为程序 bug、错误信息不指向真实原因、换机器就好。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.threshold-calibration", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/hardware-thresholds.md", "anchor": "7. 阈值校准方法", "title": "阈值校准的五步方法与最小样本要求", "tags": ["threshold", "calibration", "baseline", "sampling", "methodology"], "summary": "采集基线→确定分布→定阈值→记录→复核五步；最小样本须覆盖最低配置/主流配置/特殊环境；无法校准时沿用建议初值并降低结论强度，但不得省略检测。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.hardware-boundary", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/hardware-thresholds.md", "anchor": "8. 本篇覆盖边界", "title": "硬件判据的能力边界：能测量，判不了因果方向", "tags": ["boundary", "limitation", "hardware", "causality", "attribution"], "summary": "可确认各项测量值、是否超阈、硬件加速状态与介质类型；判不了阈值是否适合本环境、谁导致了资源压力、因果方向与间歇性峰值。", "applies_to": ["Windows"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.probing-matrix", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "1. 取证手段总表", "title": "取证手段总表：检测项到 C# 路径的映射与框架差异", "tags": ["probing", "csharp", "pinvoke", "matrix", "framework-difference"], "summary": "19 项检测的 C# 实现路径、是否需 P/Invoke、以及 .NET 8+ 与 .NET Framework 4.6.2+ 的差异；表为按需选用而非全量采集清单。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.wmi-tradeoff", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "2. WMI 的权衡", "title": "WMI 的权衡：最顺手但在故障机器上最不可靠", "tags": ["wmi", "timeout", "fallback", "reliability", "probing"], "summary": "WMI 可能因服务异常、第三方 provider bug 或安全软件拦截而挂起；须主用加独立超时加 P/Invoke 兜底，超时须记为未采集而非未安装。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.pinvoke-required", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "3. 必须 P/Invoke 的项", "title": "必须 P/Invoke 的四项：验签、WFP、LSP、系统代理", "tags": ["pinvoke", "wintrust", "wfp", "lsp", "proxy", "probing"], "summary": "WinVerifyTrust 验签、FwpmFilterEnum0 枚举 WFP、WSCEnumProtocols 查协议链、WinHttpGetIEProxyConfig 取代理——四项均无托管等价 API，含权限要求与编组陷阱。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.managed-sufficient", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "4. 托管封装够用的项", "title": "托管封装够用的项：不要为它们手写 P/Invoke", "tags": ["managed-api", "registry", "process-modules", "wow64", "probing"], "summary": "Ping、NetworkInterface、Registry、Process.Modules、DriveInfo、ServiceController 覆盖完整；须注意注册表视图必须显式指定、以及模块枚举的位数匹配与已加载限制。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.perfcounter-sampling", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "5. 性能计数", "title": "性能计数：首次读数必须丢弃，计数器名不得硬编", "tags": ["performance-counter", "sampling", "localization", "framework-difference", "probing"], "summary": "PerformanceCounter 在 .NET 8+ 需 NuGet 且不兼容 AOT；增量计数器首次 NextValue 无意义须丢弃；计数器名受系统语言影响应改用 PDH 索引；须同时采系统级与进程级。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.etw-vs-hook", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "6. ETW 与 hook 的取舍", "title": "为什么用 ETW 而不用 hook：注入会改变被观测对象", "tags": ["etw", "hook", "injection", "traceevent", "observability"], "summary": "hook 与注入改变被观测对象、触发安全软件、加剧故障且不可解释；ETW 是操作系统提供的旁路观测通道，含 TraceEvent 的权限、会话类型与 GC 压力约束。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.external-tool-orchestration", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "7. 外部工具编排", "title": "外部工具编排：优先免分发的 wpr.exe", "tags": ["wpr", "xperf", "netsh", "orchestration", "distribution"], "summary": "wpr.exe 为 Win10+ 内置免分发故为首选，xperf 须随工具分发且更易触发安全告警；编排须设超时、隔离输出、记录退出码、处理会话名冲突。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.selfcontained-publish", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "8. 发布形态约束", "title": "发布形态：不得要求用户先装运行时", "tags": ["publish", "self-contained", "single-file", "bitness", "code-signing"], "summary": "故障机器可能正是网络不通那台，.NET 8+ 须自包含发布；须按目标进程位数分发；工具自身应签名以免被安全软件拦截。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.aot-incompatibility", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "8.2 AOT 的兼容性代价", "title": "AOT 与 WMI、性能计数、TraceEvent 不兼容", "tags": ["aot", "trimming", "wmi", "reflection", "tradeoff"], "summary": "PublishAot 下 System.Management、PerformanceCounter、TraceEvent 均不可用，仅 P/Invoke 经 LibraryImport 可用；须在选型阶段权衡而非发布阶段才发现。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+"]}
{"id": "host-diagnostics.ref.probing-boundary", "kind": "reference", "file": "reference/dotnet-probing-techniques.md", "anchor": "9. 本篇覆盖边界", "title": "取证手段篇的边界：只给实现约束，不给判据", "tags": ["boundary", "limitation", "scope", "maintenance"], "summary": "本篇不覆盖判据本身、进程内故障取证、语言通用用法与完整 P/Invoke 签名；且时效性弱于其余各篇，reviewed_at 到期须重新核对框架差异。", "applies_to": ["Windows", ".NET 8+", ".NET Framework 4.6.2+"]}
